    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im just a ghost in a machine lately. like i wake up, do the same exact tasks, clock in, clock out, and sleep just to do it again. there's no \"me\" left. just a series of functions to keep some company profitable. it feels like nothing i do actually matters, like i’m just a part that’s being worn down until it's replaced.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
